            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na namwĩaĩa Yosua ĩvinda yĩu, ngyasya, Metho maku nĩmonete ũndũ w’onthe ũla Yeova Ngai waku ũmekĩte asumbĩ asu elĩ: now’o Yeova wĩmeka mosumbĩ onthe nthĩ ĩla wĩinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
